{"code":"RD07","wikidata":"Q6633329","wikipedia":{"en":"Bang Khen station","th":"สถานีบางเขน"},"summary":{"en":"Bang Khen Station is a railway station in Bangkok, serving the SRT Dark Red Line. Although the station is named Bang Khen, it is not located in the present-day Bang Khen district. It is located in Chatuchak district since Chatuchak separated from Bang Khen district in 1989.","th":"สถานีบางเขน เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าในเส้นทางรถไฟฟ้าชานเมือง สายธานีรัถยายกระดับเหนือถนนกำแพงเพชร 6 ในพื้นที่แขวงลาดยาว เขตจตุจักร กรุงเทพมหานคร เปิดให้บริการเมื่อวันที่ 2 สิงหาคม พ.ศ."},"opened":"1897-03-26","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/65/Srt-bangkhen-IMG_7438.jpg/960px-Srt-bangkhen-IMG_7438.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Srt-bangkhen-IMG_7438.jpg","author":"Vee Satayamas","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/82/201701_New_Bang_Khen_Station_under_Construction.jpg/960px-201701_New_Bang_Khen_Station_under_Construction.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:201701_New_Bang_Khen_Station_under_Construction.jpg","author":"MNXANL","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6f/6_car_train_arriving_at_Bang_Khen_station_-_5_July_2025.jpg/960px-6_car_train_arriving_at_Bang_Khen_station_-_5_July_2025.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:6_car_train_arriving_at_Bang_Khen_station_-_5_July_2025.jpg","author":"Rynamoon","license":"CC0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/Bang_Khen_Station_%28NEW%29_20230128-1.jpg/960px-Bang_Khen_Station_%28NEW%29_20230128-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"